    "Candle participation requires a visible lighting phase and an explicit animated placement; idle/cancel does not award it."
  ],
  "remainingGaps": [
    "Restoring the western building exposes the old postcard pose inside that real building. The viewpoint must move to the actual public piazza; the source building must remain.",
