    "The candle pavilion/rack is still an explicitly estimated unverified physical structure; its location and existence need verification or replacement by an honest temporary game visualization.",
    "Street boundary fences/gates and plaza ground finish are incomplete. The shared scene's first activity approach is at the Palace, not the cathedral.",
    "The available May 2025 comparison shows the real southern fence and trees, but it is not a complete post-consecration matched scene comparison.",
    "Raw audit findings remain for physical review: badGeometry 4, zfight 55, pedBelow 6.",
    "125.7 m walked toward 127 metres; planned endpoint reached using native movement and collision."
